An '''unidentified Bith musician''' performed a series of concerts on the [[planet]] [[Coruscant]] during the [[Clone Wars]], playing a wind instrument similar to a [[kloo horn]]. A series [[Painting|posters]] were put up around [[Imperial City|Galactic City]] in order to promote the [[Bith]]'s concerts.<ref name="LT">{{TCW|Lethal Trackdown}}</ref> [[Hover taxi]] advertisements were also used to attract people.<ref name="CAJ">{{TCW|To Catch a Jedi}}</ref> The [[Aurebesh]] caption, featured on posters<ref name="LT" /> and hover taxis alike,<ref name="CAJ" /> read ''[[Concert Solo]]''.<ref name="LT" /> After the war ended, the same poster appeared in [[Ord Mantell City]] on the planet [[Ord Mantell]], indicating that the [[musician]] performed there as well.<ref name="Infested">{{TBB|Infested}}</ref> Several [[Standard year|years]] later, when [[Ezra Bridger]] visited the [[Lothal Jedi Temple]], he had a vision of his quarters aboard the ''[[Ghost]]'', where the poster was lying on the floor.<ref name="Path">{{Rebels|Path of the Jedi}}</ref> It was also lying there later, when Bridger entered his quarters for real.<ref name="Steps">''[[Star Wars Rebels: Steps Into Shadow]]''</ref>

